{title: Yours Forever, Amen}
{artist: C. Michael Pilato}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 130}

Verse 1
[G]Oh, Abba Father, High King of Heaven,
[Em]Holy, [D]holy, is Your [C]Name.
[G]Your kingdom come and Your will be done in
[Em]Heaven above [D]and earth the [G]same.

Verse 2
Oh, Abba Father, High King of Heaven,
[Em]Give us [D]daily all we [C]need.
[G]And please forgive us, as we forgive those,
[Em]Who, like us, [D]caused Your Son to [C]bleed.

Chorus
Yours forever [Cadd9]is the kingdom!  Yours forever [Dsus]is the [D]power!
Yours forever [Cadd9]is the glory, amen!
[G/B]Yours forever [Cadd9]is the kingdom!  Yours forever [Dsus]is the [D]power!
Yours forever [Cadd9]is the glory, amen!  [D]Amen.

Verse 3
[G]Oh, Abba Father, High King of Heaven,
[Em]Rescue [D]us from the evil [C]one,
[G]And lead us far from every temptation —
[Em]This bride [D]keep spotless for Your [G]Son.

Chorus
Yours forever [Cadd9]is the kingdom!  Yours forever [Dsus]is the [D]power!
Yours forever [Cadd9]is the glory, amen!
[G/B]Yours forever [Cadd9]is the kingdom!  Yours forever [Dsus]is the [D]power!
Yours forever [Cadd9]is the glory, amen!  [D]Amen.

Verse 4
[Em]To You, who's [D/F#]able to do (so much)
[G]More than we ask or (could) [C]even imagine,
[Em]Be endless glory, [D/F#]love and fame.
[G]Bring endless glory (to Your name)!

Verse 5
Yours forever is the kingdom!  Yours forever is the power!
Yours forever is the glory, amen!
Yours forever is the kingdom!  Yours forever is the power!
Yours forever is the glory, amen!  Amen.
Yours forever, amen.
Yours forever, amen.
